    "Configure the device to send traps to this host under Services → SNMP → Trap Settings. Most Teltonika traps carry no values, so a trap is recorded and triggers an immediate poll of that device.": "在设备的 Services → SNMP → Trap Settings 中将 Trap 发送到此主机。多数 Teltonika Trap 不携带数值，因此收到后仅记录事件并立即轮询该设备。",
