    "Enter the MAC address the router shows under Status → Wireless, not the one printed on the phone: phones use a separate random address per network. It changes again when the network is forgotten and rejoined.": "请输入路由器在 Status → Wireless 下显示的 MAC 地址，而不是手机上印的地址：手机对每个网络使用单独的随机地址。忘记网络并重新连接后，该地址会再次改变。",
    "Every row is a person with one or more MAC addresses, separated by commas, and an optional group. The person gets its own branch under presence.persons with present, last arrival and departure, since when, the sums of the day and the last comings and goings; it is present while one of the routers reports one of its addresses as associated to Wi-Fi. Persons of one group are summarised under presence.groups. Read over SNMP only: the MQTT publisher of a router cannot report its clients.": "每一行是一个人员，带有一个或多个以逗号分隔的 MAC 地址以及可选的分组。该人员在 presence.persons 下获得自己的分支：是否在家、最近到达和离开、持续时间、当天累计以及最近的到达和离开记录；只要有路由器报告其任一地址已连接 Wi-Fi，即视为在家。同一分组的人员汇总在 presence.groups 下。仅通过 SNMP：路由器的 MQTT 发布器无法报告其客户端。",
